WEBVTT

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:32.246
The commander who pressed the button
and triggered the event?

00:02:32.246 --> 00:02:34.621
The IT engineer
who created the computers,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:38.121
knowing that they were intended
to allow an attack?

00:02:38.121 --> 00:02:40.996
Because war is part
of our universe for so long,

00:02:40.996 --> 00:02:44.496
we have laws to determine who
should be held accountable

00:02:44.496 --> 00:02:46.746
for actions they took in combat.

00:02:46.746 --> 00:02:48.913
These legal frameworks aim at containing

00:02:48.913 --> 00:02:52.246
and at preventing atrocities
from being even more atrocious.

00:02:52.246 --> 00:02:55.413
Commanding civilian aircrafts
and using them as weapons,

00:02:55.413 --> 00:02:56.788
dropping atomic bombs,

00:02:56.788 --> 00:03:00.413
using gas chambers
or poisonous gas in conflicts...